# ─── Raw and intermediate data ────────────────────────────────────────
# Primary data is public (see config/config.yaml for Dryad DOIs) —
# users regenerate with scripts/data/download_hickey_dryad.py.
# Paths are anchored to repo root so scripts/data/ is NOT matched.
/data/
/external/

# ─── Large regenerated linkage outputs ────────────────────────────────
# Per-method peak–gene linkage TSVs reach 764 MB each (~3 GB total) and are
# trivially regenerated by running scripts/linkage/method*.py. We commit
# 1,000-row samples as {method}/{compartment}_sample.tsv for inspection.
# Ignore full files:
results/linkage/method1/*.tsv
results/linkage/method2/*.tsv
results/linkage/method3/*.tsv
results/linkage/method4_paired/*.tsv
results/linkage/method4_crosscohort/*.tsv
results/linkage/method5/*.tsv
# …but keep the {compartment}_sample.tsv files:
!results/linkage/method1/*_sample.tsv
!results/linkage/method2/*_sample.tsv
!results/linkage/method3/*_sample.tsv
!results/linkage/method4_paired/*_sample.tsv
!results/linkage/method4_crosscohort/*_sample.tsv
!results/linkage/method5/*_sample.tsv

# The Method 4B anchor-agreement diagnostic TSVs are kept in full
# (small; they back Figure 4 and Table 3).

# ─── Python cache / build artefacts ───────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/

# ─── IDE / OS junk ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ─── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log
